      <p class="eyebrow">Before anything is mounted</p>
      <h2>Four decisions shape the system.</h2>
    </div>
    <ol>
      <li><span>01</span><div><strong>Sightline &amp; lighting</strong><p>Account for the direction of travel, daytime contrast, nighttime conditions, and obstructions.</p></div></li>
      <li><span>02</span><div><strong>Image detail</strong><p>Match mounting position and field of view to what the business needs to see.</p></div></li>
      <li><span>03</span><div><strong>Recording &amp; network</strong><p>Discuss recording expectations, connectivity, and practical constraints before installation.</p></div></li>
      <li><span>04</span><div><strong>People &amp; access</strong><p>Decide who needs live or recorded video and how they will retrieve it.</p></div></li>
